"Turn on only when what a customer saves could reveal sensitive personal data. The garage is then "
"kept for the visit only and not saved to the account."
msgstr ""
"Aktivieren Sie dies nur, wenn das, was ein Kunde speichert, sensible personenbezogene Daten "
